        "official_en_sha256": "32c3b5a6d7eee875a6da5df419ce31620ab286ac99e7520346c06e6ab37f22ee"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ガレキの撤去中ですので、\r\n城内には立ち入らぬようお願いします。",
        "official_en": "Apologies, sirs, but we’re still clearing debris inside the castle.\r\nFor safety’s sake, the interior is off-limits to anyone besides the workers.",
        "real_en": "We're still clearing the rubble, so please don't enter the castle."
      },
