        "official_en_sha256": "bb05abf191fcaafad000e799bd732d6c3ce0e080a56133ae760bf1161b4d5ad5"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "スコットさんが来てくれれば\r\n我々もとても心強いです。",
        "official_en": "We’d all feel a lot better if Scott was here with us.",
        "real_en": "Having Scott-san here would be very reassuring."
      },
