      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ネコちゃんたちも無事でよかったわ。\r\n逃げ出さなかったのは、\r\nよほどここが気に入っているんだねえ。",
        "official_en": "I’m so glad these little dears are all right. They must’ve really taken a liking to this place, seeing as the fires didn’t scare them off.",
