      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ミトラから物資が送られてきたんだ。\r\nこれで復旧作業を進められるぞ！",
        "official_en": "We just got some supplies from Mitra! We’ll be sure to put ’em to good use.",
        "real_en": "Supplies have arrived from Mitra! Now we can get on with the reconstruction!"
