        "official_en_sha256": "81479243888340a70ff2f073620079b443c80e84b96d38f286effe2a5802ebaa"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "レイン、ラスウェル。\r\nグランシェルトの騎士として\r\n常に弱き者の剣たれ。",
        "official_en": "Rain. Lasswell. As knights of Grandshelt, you must be a shield for the weak and defenseless.",
        "real_en": "Rain, Lasswell. As knights of Grandshelt, always be a sword for the weak."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
