      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "先人たちに胸を張れるように、\r\n完璧に作り直してやるぜ。",
        "official_en": "But I’ll sure as hell make ’em proud by rebuilding what they made.",
        "real_en": "I'll restore it down to the last detail, so I can hold my head high before those who came before us."
