      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "六盟傑か……\r\n奴の強さはケタ違いだった……。",
        "official_en": "Those so-called Sworn Six...they were unfathomably formidable.",
        "real_en": "One of the Sworn Six... That one's strength was on an entirely different level..."
