      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "嬉しい反面、親としてはやっぱり心配です。",
        "official_en": "As a parent, I can’t help but worry, though. I hope he understands that knights put their lives on the line...",
        "real_en": "I'm happy, of course, but as his mother, I can't help worrying."
      },
