      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "正直、再び相対することを想像すると、\r\n身体が震える……。",
        "official_en": "Truth be told, the mere thought of confronting them once more stirs quiet dread within me...",
        "real_en": "To be honest, I tremble just imagining having to face that one again..."
